WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.367
You know the shot.

00:01.367 --> 00:03.100
The model can only guess.

00:04.000 --> 00:05.600
Nomi keeps the story,

00:05.600 --> 00:10.100
storyboard and generation
context connected from the first line.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.633
Lock characters, locations,
props, and style first,

00:16.633 --> 00:19.033
so every shot inherits the same world

00:19.033 --> 00:21.500
instead of restarting
from another prompt.

00:24.033 --> 00:26.400
Build on a visual canvas.

00:26.400 --> 00:28.633
Let the assistant draft prompts,

00:28.633 --> 00:29.767
place media

00:29.767 --> 00:33.800
and call generation tools while you
keep the whole sequence in view.

00:35.000 --> 00:36.833
Found the right reference,

00:36.833 --> 00:41.933
capture it, reverse the prompt,
and reuse it without changing tools.

00:43.000 --> 00:44.200
Connect your models.

00:44.200 --> 00:49.767
ComfyUI and AI coding assistants
without locking into one provider.

00:50.033 --> 00:51.567
From intent to timeline,

00:51.567 --> 00:54.667
directing becomes one
continuous workflow.

00:55.033 --> 00:56.533
Download Nomi.

00:56.533 --> 00:58.000
for AGPL-compliant custom work

00:58.000 --> 00:59.433
builds. Talk to us.
